REGLAS DE CÁLCULO
=========================================================================

Para cada dimensión:

Revenue =
SUM(Revenue accounts)

Expense =
SUM(Expense accounts)

NetResult =
Revenue - Expense

Margin =
NetResult

MarginPercentage =
(NetResult / Revenue) * 100

=========================================================================

REGLA SOBRE ACCOUNT TYPE
=========================================================================

REVENUE:

contribuye a Revenue.

EXPENSE:

contribuye a Expense.

ASSET:

no contribuye a Revenue ni Expense.

LIABILITY:

no contribuye a Revenue ni Expense.

EQUITY:

no contribuye a Revenue ni Expense.

=========================================================================

REGLA SOBRE SIGNOS
=========================================================================

Revenue:

credit - debit

Expense:

debit - credit

Esto mantiene la misma semántica utilizada por:

IncomeStatement

y:

AnalyticalReport

